      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you're experiencing a profound sense of loss, where the identity you built around your athletic life has been stripped away, leaving a hollow space. This feeling of being disconnected from your own body and purpose is a heavy burden to carry. Please know that this intense grief is a real response to such a massive life change. Reaching out to a therapist or counselor can provide you with a safe space to navigate these complex emotions and begin to build a new sense of self.",
      "source": "target",
